# Project core

- Client-only Vite + React SPA. No Next.js, no backend, no real file upload.
- Package manager: **pnpm** only.
- User media stays in browser memory (`File` / `objectURL`); never send to a server or Cache Storage.
- All user-facing strings go through **i18n** (`en` first).
- Every interactive or structural UI element must have a **stable `id`** (tour, a11y, tests). Pattern: `app-*`, `media-*`, `tab-*`, `media-card-{id}`, `diff-row-{itemId}-{fieldKey}`.
- Prefer minimal diffs; follow existing folder layout under `src/`.
